    "text": "abcnews4.com\nwebsite\nBerkeley County, South Carolina\nBerkeley County approves $231M budget with no tax increase, boosts public safety\nBy ABC NEWS 4 STAFF,\n9 hours agoBERKELEY COUNTY, S.C. (WCIV) — The Berkeley County Council recently approved a $231 million budget for the 2025-2026 fiscal year, which began on Monday. Council approved the budget on Monday, June 23, and it features no millage (or tax) increase. The millage rate will remain at 41 mills, continuing as the lowest County millage rate in South Carolina, officials said.\n1",
